[Term]
id: BSPO:0000005
name: anatomical surface
namespace: spatial
def: "A 2D surface of an anatomical continuant" [BSPO:cjm]
def: "A 2D surface of an anatomical continuant." [BSPO:cjm]
comment: to be merged into CARO
